		{"type":"text","id":"13e49930b37b4eda","x":286,"y":145,"width":220,"height":355,"color":"#b4befe","text":"**Loi physique**\n\nUne loi définit, en physique, un rapport immuable entre plusieurs grandeurs."},
		{
			"type":"file",
			"id":"4f9496a914d046f2",
